      "description": "Refuses another BS month than the component's Pay Month, or a second draft for the year; builds (or rebuilds) the entry's draft Payroll Adjustment from `compute_rows`.\n\nReads: Salary Component `custom_festival_pay_month`; Payroll Adjustment `source`, `payroll_entry`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/festival_allowance.py",
      "line": 121,
      "title": "11.3 compute_rows",
      "description": "Per employee on the entry: leaves out joiners on/after the cut-off, leavers (unless included), short service, daily wage (unless included), no assignment, already paid; else one row with basic, service days, factor and amount.\n\nReads: Salary Component `custom_festival_*`; Employee `date_of_joining`, `relieving_date`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/festival_allowance.py",
      "line": 74,
      "title": "11.4 service_factor",
      "description": "Service days = cut-off − joining; year days = the year ending on the cut-off (365/366); 1 for a full year, else service ÷ year, clamped 0..1."
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/festival_allowance.py",
      "line": 102,
      "title": "11.5 monthly_basic",
      "description": "The assignment `base` on the cut-off (a daily wage × the BS month's days).\n\nReads: Salary Structure Assignment `base`; Salary Structure `custom_daily_wage`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/festival_allowance.py",
      "line": 94,
      "title": "11.6 festival_amount",
      "description": "basic × factor, never above basic; proration off pays a full month for any service.\n\nReads: Salary Component `custom_festival_prorate`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/avinash_group_app/doctype/payroll_adjustment/payroll_adjustment.py",
      "line": 34,
      "title": "11.7 PayrollAdjustment.validate_rows",
      "description": "Refuses a row above its `base_amount` (the 100 % cap survives hand edits).\n\nReads: Payroll Adjustment Row `base_amount`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/avinash_group_app/doctype/payroll_adjustment/payroll_adjustment.py",
      "line": 81,
      "title": "11.8 PayrollAdjustment.on_submit",
      "description": "One submitted Additional Salary per row, full tax in the month; then re-saves the people's draft slips."
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/public/js/payroll_entry.js",
      "line": 270,
      "title": "11.9 leave_encashment",
      "description": "Payroll Entry → **Nepal HRMS → Leave Encashment**: confirm, then the review table (occasion, balance, days, rate, amount) and who was left out."
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 210,
      "title": "11.10 leave_encashment.encash_for_payroll_entry",
      "description": "From the payroll month's first day: the entry's employees → `encash_month` for its dates — Year End when an allocation ends in the month (Ashadh), Separation for anyone relieved in it.\n\nReads: Payroll Entry `start_date` / `end_date`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 244,
      "title": "11.11 encash_month",
      "description": "Per due (employee, type, allocation): skips one already submitted, rebuilds a draft, inserts a Leave Encashment dated the allocation's end.\n\nReads: Leave Period; Leave Encashment"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 184,
      "title": "11.12 due_encashments",
      "description": "Allocations of Allow Encashment types ending in the month (year end) or covering a relieving date in it (separation).\n\nReads: Leave Type `allow_encashment`, `custom_encash_at_year_end`, `custom_encash_at_separation`; Leave Allocation"
    },
    {
      "file": "../hrms/hrms/hr/doctype/leave_encashment/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 79,
      "title": "11.13 LeaveEncashment.get_leave_details_for_encashment",
      "description": "HRMS: balance = allocated − carried + leaves taken; days capped by Non-Encashable / Maximum Encashable Leaves.\n\nReads: Leave Type `non_encashable_leaves`, `max_encashable_leaves`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 92,
      "title": "11.14 price_encashment",
      "description": "After HRMS's validate: refuses a second encashment of the allocation, a date that is neither year end nor relieving date, an occasion the type does not allow; amount = days × `per_day_rate`.\n\nReads: Leave Type `custom_encash_at_*`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 71,
      "title": "11.15 per_day_rate",
      "description": "Assignment `base` ÷ Leave Type `custom_encashment_days_per_month` (blank = the BS month's days).\n\nReads: Salary Structure Assignment `base`"
    },
    {
      "file": "../hrms/hrms/hr/doctype/leave_encashment/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 155,
      "title": "11.16 LeaveEncashment.create_additional_salary",
      "description": "HRMS on submit: Additional Salary on the type's Earning Component, dated the encashment date.\n\nReads: Leave Type `earning_component`"
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 134,
      "title": "11.17 mark_additional_salary",
      "description": "Additional Salary validate: an encashment's row is taxed in full in its month and tagged."
    },
    {
      "file": "avinashgroup_app/payroll/leave_encashment.py",
      "line": 146,
      "title": "11.18 link_additional_salary",
      "description": "Additional Salary on_submit: writes it back to the encashment so cancelling one cancels the other."
